ransition-colors hover:border-accent/50 hover:text-text" href="/aion-2/database/en/pet-genus/">Pet Genus</a><a class="border border-border bg-bg2/45 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-muted transition-colors hover:border-accent/50 hover:text-text" href="/aion-2/database/en/shop/">Shop Browser</a><a class="border border-border bg-bg2/45 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-muted transition-colors hover:border-accent/50 hover:text-text" href="/aion-2/database/en/conversion/">Conversion Recipes</a><a class="border border-border bg-bg2/45 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-muted transition-colors hover:border-accent/50 hover:text-text" href="/aion-2/database/en/seasons/">Season Calendar</a><a class="border border-border bg-bg2/45 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-muted transition-colors hover:border-accent/50 hover:text-text" href="/aion-2/database/en/drop-rates/">Drop Rates</a><a class="border border-border bg-bg2/45 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-muted transition-colors hover:border-accent/50 hover:text-text" href="/aion-2/database/en/costumes/">Costumes &amp; Skins</a><a class="border border-border bg-bg2/45 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-muted transition-colors hover:border-accent/50 hover:text-text" href="/aion-2/database/en/hidden-cubes/">Hidden Cubes</a><a class="border border-border bg-bg2/45 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-muted transition-colors hover:border-accent/50 hover:text-text" href="/aion-2/database/en/nightmare/">Nightmare Guide</a><a class="border border-border bg-bg2/45 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-muted transition-colors hover:border-accent/50 hover:text-text" href="/aion-2/database/en/world-bosses/">World Bosses</a></div></div><aside class="border border-border bg-surface p-5 shadow-card"><h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-[#f6ecd7]">Browse database types</h2><div class="mt-3 space-y-2"><a class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border/40 pb-2 text-sm hover:text-accent" href="/aion-2/database/en/item/"><span>Items</span><span class="tabular-nums text-faint">13.408</span></a><a class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border/40 pb-2 text-sm hover:text-accent" href="/aion-2/database/en/npc/"><span>NPCs</span><span class="tabular-nums text-faint">14.083</span></a><a class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border/40 pb-2 text-sm hover:text-accent" href="/aion-2/database/en/quest/"><span>Quests</span><span class="tabular-nums text-faint">1.119</span></a><a class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border/40 pb-2 text-sm hover:text-accent" href="/aion-2/database/en/skill/"><span>Skills</span><span class="tabular-nums text-faint">330</span></a><a class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border/40 pb-2 text-sm hover:text-accent" href="/aion-2/database/en/achievement/"><span>Achievements</span><span class="tabular-nums text-faint">2.787</span></a><a class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border/40 pb-2 text-sm hover:text-accent" href="/aion-2/database/en/pet/"><span>Pets</span><span class="tabular-nums text-faint">227</span></a><a class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border/40 pb-2 text-sm hover:text-accent" href="/aion-2/database/en/wing/"><span>Wings</span><span class="tabular-nums text-faint">116</span></a><a class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border/40 pb-2 text-sm hover:text-accent" href="/aion-2/database/en/recipe/"><span>Recipes</span><span class="tabular-nums text-faint">2.442</span></a></div></aside></section><section class="mt-5 border border-border bg-surface p-5 shadow-card"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-3"><div><div class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Content coverage</div><h2 class="mt-1 font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#f6ecd7]">More than an item list</h2></div><a class="text-xs font-bold text-[#e3bd6e] hover:text-accent" href="/aion-2/database/en/tools/">Open every tool →</a></div><p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">The database also connects farming, exploration, progression and account-tracked systems, so players can move from a record to the exact planner, timer or map view they need.</p><div class="mt-4 grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><a class="border border-border bg-bg2/45 p-3 transition-colors hover:border-accent/50 hover:bg-surface2" href="/aion-2/database/en/drop-rates/"><h3 class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-text">Drop Rates</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">Dungeon loot, item grades, farming source filters and drop chances.</p></a><a class="border border-border bg-bg2/45 p-3 transition-colors hover:border-accent/50 hover:bg-surface2" href="/aion-2/database/en/hidden-cubes/"><h3 class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-text">Hidden Cubes</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">Zone-by-zone cube routes with exact interactive-map links.</p></a><a class="border border-border bg-bg2/45 p-3 transition-colors hover:border-accent/50 hover:bg-surface2" href="/aion-2/database/en/nightmare/"><h3 class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-text">Nightmare</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">Solo boss layers, challenge levels, item-level gates and rewards.</p></a><a class="border border-border bg-bg2/45 p-3 transition-colors hover:border-accent/50 hover:bg-surface2" href="/aion-2/database/en/world-objects/"><h3 class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-text">World Objects</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">Rifts, gathering nodes, monoliths, portals, artifacts and map-marker categories.</p></a><a class="border border-border bg-bg2/45 p-3 transition-colors hover:border-accent/50 hover:bg-surface2" href="/aion-2/database/en/quests/"><h3 class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-text">Quests</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">Quest filters by faction, level, type, rewards and linked NPCs.</p></a><a class="border border-border bg-bg2/45 p-3 transition-colors hover:border-accent/50 hover:bg-surface2" href="/aion-2/database/en/dungeons/"><h3 class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-text">Dungeons</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">Dungeon records, map IDs, instance flags and content filters.</p></a><a class="border border-border bg-bg2/45 p-3 transition-colors hover:border-accent/50 hover:bg-surface2" href="/aion-2/database/en/achievements/"><h3 class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-text">Achievements</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">Achievement groups, objectives, steps, cadence and rewards.</p></a><a class="border border-border bg-bg2/45 p-3 transition-colors hover:border-accent/50 hover:bg-surface2" href="/aion-2/database/en/titles/"><h3 class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-text">Titles</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">Title records, effects, search filters and collection browsing.</p></a><a class="border border-border bg-bg2/45 p-3 transition-colors hover:border-accent/50 hover:bg-surface2" href="/aion-2/database/en/costumes/"><h3 class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-text">Costumes &amp; Skins</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">Outfit sets, armor skins, weapon skins, accessories, icons and item links.</p></a></div></section><section class="mt-5 border border-border bg-surface p-7 shadow-card"><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#e3bd6e] mb-4">About the Aion 2 Database &amp; Interactive Map</h2><div class="space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted"><p>Welcome to the most comprehensive <strong class="text-text">Aion 2 Database</strong>. Built for the highly anticipated MMORPG sequel developed by NCSoft in Unreal Engine 5, our platform provides players with everything they need for the global release. Whether you are playing as an Elyos or Asmodian, you can explore detailed item stats, skill scaling, and drop rates sourced directly from the official client files.</p><p>Use the <strong class="text-text">Aion 2 Build Calculator</strong> to theorycraft your perfect character setup. Choose between the 9 core classes—Templar, Gladiator, Assassin, Ranger, Sorcerer, Elementalist, Chanter, Cleric, and Brawler. Customize your gear enhancements, Soul Inscriptions, and Stigma slots, and integrate Pet insight bonuses to maximize your PvP and PvE potential.</p><p>Beyond the database, our <strong class="text-text">Aion 2 Interactive Map</strong> tracks every gathering node, World Boss spawn, Hidden Cube, and Rift location across all zones. Combine map tracking with our live Event Timers and Drop Rate filters to optimize your farming routes and stay ahead in the Abyss.</p></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></div><footer class="mt-12 border-t border-border bg-bg2/40"><div class="mx-auto max-w-screen-2xl px-4 py-7 text-center"><nav class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm"><a href="https://gamers4.life/advertise" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-muted transition-colors hover:text-text">Advertise</a><a href="https://gamers4.life/contact" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-muted transition-colors hover:text-text">Contact</a><a href="https://gamers4.life/copyright" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-muted transition-colors hover:text-text">Copyright</a><a href="https://gamers4.life/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-muted transition-colors hover:text-text">Terms</a><a href="https://gamers4.life/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-muted transition-colors hover:text-text">Privacy</a></nav><p class="mt-5 text-xs text-faint">© 2026 Gamers4Life. All rights reserved.</p><p class="mx-auto mt-1.5 max-w-2xl text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-faint/75">Gamers4Life is a fan-made site and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by NCSOFT. Aion 2 and all related logos, characters, and assets are trademarks or registered trademarks of NCSOFT Corporation.</p></div></footer><div cla